{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"externalID":"LifecycleTracking","role":"collection","symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","modules":[{"name":"LifecycleTracking"}],"title":"LifecycleTracking"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/Trackers\/Tracker\/trackLifecycle(kinds:version:versionStore:notificationCenter:file:fileID:function:line:column:)","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation"],"title":"Tracking the lifecycle","anchor":"Tracking-the-lifecycle"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationInstalled","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationUpdated","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationTerminated"],"title":"Events","anchor":"Events"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/VersionStore","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/FileVersionStore","doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/InMemoryVersionStore"],"title":"Keeping the version","anchor":"Keeping-the-version"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleBatchStrategy"],"title":"Delivering as the app leaves","anchor":"Delivering-as-the-app-leaves"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/Afluent"],"title":"Extended Modules","generated":true,"anchor":"Extended-Modules"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this module to track the application’s lifecycle on any platform. Nothing is tracked until","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the app calls ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"trackLifecycle"},{"text":" on its tracker as it launches, and keeps the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation"},{"text":" it returns; tracking stops when that is cancelled, finished or released.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For the screens and controls inside the app, see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/automatictracking"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"As it starts, it compares the app’s version ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CFBundleShortVersionString"},{"type":"text","text":" by default, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"version:"},{"type":"text","text":") with the one its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/VersionStore","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" saved at the last launch. No saved version tracks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationInstalled","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", a different one "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationUpdated","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", the same one neither. Then it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracks "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". After that, from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIApplication"},{"type":"text","text":"’s, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WKApplication"},{"type":"text","text":"’s or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSApplication"},{"type":"text","text":"’s notifications, it tracks "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationOpened","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the background and, where the platform reports it, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationTerminated","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", each once per"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transition. A server or a tool on Linux has no notifications, so it calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation\/finish()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" as it ends:"}]},{"code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let lifecycle = tracker.trackLifecycle(version: \"2.1\", versionStore: InMemoryVersionStore(version: \"2.0\"))","\/\/ tracks ApplicationUpdated(previousVersion: \"2.0\", version: \"2.1\"), then ApplicationOpened(fromBackground: false)","","\/\/ ... the process's work ...","","await lifecycle.finish()  \/\/ tracks ApplicationTerminated","await tracker.finish()"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The store keeps the version and nothing else. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/FileVersionStore","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" keeps it in a file, by default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"beside a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SegmentStore"},{"type":"text","text":"’s records; "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/InMemoryVersionStore","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" keeps it in memory, for tests; any type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of yours can conform. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"kinds:"},{"type":"text","text":" turns kinds of event off, while the version is still saved."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"As the app leaves the foreground, it waits for the tracker’s worker to write every record tracked","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so far to the tracker’s store, then calls the store’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"synchronize()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A delivery batched with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleBatchStrategy","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"code":".lifecycle","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") sends what is pending as it reads the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/ApplicationBackgrounded","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" record. The notification’s handler only hands the transition on; the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"work runs on a task of its own, and where the system suspends apps in the background it holds","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"background time until the records are durable.","type":"text"}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Track the app’s installs, updates, opens, moves to the background and terminations, and make the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s records durable as the app leaves the foreground."}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLan